config MESHTASTIC_AIRTIME
	bool "Meshtastic channel and TX airtime accounting"
	default y
	help
	  Track LoRa time-on-air for TX and RX: the regulatory duty-cycle gate
	  (MESHTASTIC_DUTY_CYCLE) and the contention window read it, and, when
	  device metrics are built, DeviceMetrics telemetry reports it as
	  channel_utilization and air_util_tx, matching official firmware.

	  Not dependent on MESHTASTIC_DEVICE_METRICS (agents-ls39.1.13): until
	  2026-11-25 it was, so turning off device-metrics telemetry silently
	  removed the duty-cycle gate with it. The telemetry reads this under its
	  own #if; the accounting itself needs nothing from it.
